abstract: >-
  Code and benchmark of a local search for multi-agent path finding that
  improves a feasible plan by searching exactly, by dynamic programming on a
  sequentialized automaton, the best plan within a neighborhood of it, with
  incomplete searches of larger neighborhoods and combinations with MAPF-LNS
  and LaCAM*.
keywords:
  - multi-agent path finding
  - local search
  - dynamic programming
  - neighborhood search
  - directed graphs
